cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ONT Human Variation Suite: reproducible downstream pipelines for Oxford Nanopore wf-human-variation output"
abstract: >-
  A suite of config-driven, test-covered pipelines for downstream analysis of
  Oxford Nanopore sequencing processed by the Epi2ME wf-human-variation workflow.
  Each variant class is handled by its own pipeline sharing common conventions:
  structural variants (Sniffles2 VCF categorisation, gene fusion and disruption
  classification) and CpG methylation (modkit bedMethyl extraction, per-site
  filtering, gene/promoter/CpG-island aggregation, and cross-sample comparison).
  Copy number and small variant pipelines are planned.
